  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can meditate as an immediate action to preempt the action of another creature. If you do so, you can endure an effect as part of the action to meditate and the meditation only lasts until the end of your next turn (it does not last long enough to use a (clarity) talent).</p>\n<p>You can reveal and spend a plan as part of this action to ignore this restriction on duration and treat the meditation as having lasted since you last prepared plans so long as you have not adopted an approach since doing so. This enables the use of (contemplation) talents.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/body-control#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
